iros"},{"id":38516,"name":"Denys Arcand","role":"Unionist (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jYqHVVAHbhNvFCMmi2wUm8IanRp.jpg"},{"id":81468,"name":"Fanny Mallette","role":"(uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8iRMCNBmt3RQFBGcQHBpeWEn7ju.jpg"},{"id":36481,"name":"Françoise Hardy","role":"Self (archive footage) (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vT7nxPjWPBa0pSvVQRWfyNG6sCy.jpg"},{"id":1666,"name":"Julie Christie","role":"Self (archive footage) (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/siAi4XZhDPP8LRgbByzwLqVaLIQ.jpg"},{"id":46986,"name":"Chris Evert","role":"Self (archive footage) (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A48QDxeagITZPRp8vwWKemWXrl1.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Le invasioni barbariche","overview":"Remy, un cinquantenne professore di storia, ha un tumore e viene ricoverato. L'ex moglie Louise chiede al figlio Sébastien, affermato uomo d'affari che vive a Londra, di venire a trovare il padre, anche se tra i due i rapporti si sono praticamente interrotti da tempo. Sébastien parte e raggiunge l'ospedale a Montréal; resosi conto della gravità della malattia del padre cerca di fare di tutto per rendergli gli ultimi giorni lieti e sopportabili.Così, col suo denaro paga funzionari ospedalieri e sindacalisti per mettere in ordine un reparto, chiama i vecchi amici e fiamme del padre avvisandoli e invitandoli ad andare da lui, paga alcuni ex-allievi perché lo vadano a trovare, farà comperare eroina per alleviare i dolori della malattia.Il tempo passa inesorabilmente fino a quando Remy — stanco della sua situazione — riceverà il colpo di grazia con un'overdose, che lo libererà dalla continua sofferenza."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Barbarian Invasions","overview":"In this belated sequel to 'The Decline of the American Empire', middle-aged Montreal college professor, Remy, learns that he is dying of liver cancer. His ex-wife, Louise, asks their estranged son, Sebastian, a successful businessman living in London, to come home. Sebastian makes the impossible happen, using his contacts and disrupting the Canadian healthcare system in every way possible to help his father fight his terminal illness to the bitter end, while reuniting some of Remy's old friends, including Pierre, Alain, Dominique, Diane, and Claude, who return to see their friend before he passes on.","tagline":"A comedy about sex, friendship, and all other things that invade our lives."},{"language":"fr-FR","title":"Les Invasions barbares","overview":"Rémy, divorcé, la cinquantaine, est à l'hôpital. Son ex-femme Louise rappelle d'urgence leur fils Sébastien, installé à Londres. Ce dernier hésite - son père et lui n'ont plus rien à se dire depuis longtemps. Finalement, il accepte de revenir à Montréal pour aider sa mère et soutenir son père. Dès son arrivée, Sébastien remue ciel et terre, joue de ses relations, bouscule le système de toutes les manières possibles pour adoucir les épreuves qui attendent Rémy. Il ramène aussi au chevet de Rémy la joyeuse bande qui a marqué son passé : parents, amis et anciennes maîtresses. Que sont-ils devenus à l'heure des « invasions barbares » ? L'irrévérence, l'amitié et la truculence sont-elles toujours au rendez-vous ? L'humour, l'épicurisme, le désir peuplent-ils toujours leurs rêves ? À l'heure des invasions barbares, le déclin de l'empire américain continue...","tagline":"Le déclin de l'empire américain continue !"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5tDzKr88ARCWaxmiYiQ7ZWI0w4K.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7PefpVkSOiQmcdGv6TGHU8kn296.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":11042,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"typ